# Keep repo-root Docker build contexts small (e.g. sp1-prover/Dockerfile.network,
# which must build from the repo root to reach core-layer/sp1-hooks).
# Exclude the heavy / irrelevant trees; the SP1 image only needs sp1-prover/ +
# core-layer/sp1-hooks.
**/node_modules
**/.git
**/target
**/dist
**/build
**/.next
**/coverage
**/*.log
.github
xfuel-app
docs
deploy
believer
zkgpt-prover
sdk
skills
backend
